If an ICU stay of a patient is annotated by more than one class (vector) within an ontology, then the vectors for each annotated class are summed. This aggregation approach follows the one used by [16] for the ICD9 embeddings. More formally, the embedding vector that represents a patient p under a given ontology o is given by the sum of each embedding vector \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
