We evaluated our approach in the MIMIC-III EHR data set, and experimented with different ontologies and controlled vocabularies (NCIT, LOINC, DRON and ICD9CM), KG embeddings techniques and ML algorithms. The best results were obtained using RDF2Vec embeddings of the NCIT ontology coupled with a Random Forest, achieving a mean AUROC of 0.827 \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
